# Drop the AMLworld files here. The data itself is git-ignored (data/raw/*.csv,
# data/raw/*.txt) because HI-Small alone is ~500 MB; this placeholder only keeps
# the directory in the tree so a fresh clone has somewhere to put it.
#
# Expected layout — see the root README, sections "Setup" and "Data sources":
#
#   data/raw/
#   ├── HI-Small_Trans.csv        development + demo (5,078,345 rows)
#   ├── HI-Small_Patterns.txt     held-out ground truth, evaluation only
#   ├── HI-Small_accounts.csv     account -> entity map
#   ├── LI-Small_Trans.csv        false-positive evaluation (optional)
#   ├── LI-Small_Patterns.txt
#   └── LI-Small_accounts.csv
#
# Note the AMLworld naming quirk: Trans.csv and Patterns.txt are capitalised,
# accounts.csv is lowercase. Verify a load with:
#
#   cd backend && .venv/bin/python -m nexus.ingest --variant HI-Small
